<section class="testimonials container reveal">
  <h2 class="reveal d1" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;">What guests say</h2>
  <p class="reveal d2" style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin-top:0;margin-bottom:18px;">Cozy place in the Old City — walk to cafés, temples and markets.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="tcard reveal d1">
      <div class="t-head">
        <div class="avatar"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">Anna · DE</div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Perfect location near Wat Phra Singh. Quiet lane, friendly host. Would stay again!</p>
      <div class="meta">Stayed 3 nights · Jan</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tcard reveal d2">
      <div class="t-head">
        <div class="avatar"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">Ken · SG</div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Clean room, fast Wi-Fi, and Grab finds it easily with the taxi note. Great value.</p>
      <div class="meta">Work trip · Mar</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tcard reveal d3">
      <div class="t-head">
        <div class="avatar"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">Maria · ES</div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Walkable to everything in Old City. Loved the quick links: Map, WhatsApp, copy address!</p>
      <div class="meta">Couple · May</div>
